data: {"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"### permit2@latest::AllowanceTransferTest::__contract__~7\n`permit2@latest` · repo:cc56ad0f3439c502c246fc5cfcc3db92bb8b7219 · as_of 2023-09-29T15:36:13Z\nhttps://github.com/Uniswap/permit2/blob/cc56ad0f3439c502c246fc5cfcc3db92bb8b7219/test/AllowanceTransferTest.t.sol#L666-L694\n\n```\nbytes memory sig = getPermitBatchSignature(permit, fromPrivateKey, DOMAIN_SEPARATOR);\n```\n\n### permit2@latest::AllowanceTransferTest::setUp\n`permit2@latest` · repo:cc56ad0f3439c502c246fc5cfcc3db92bb8b7219 · as_of 2023-09-29T15:36:13Z\nhttps://github.com/Uniswap/permit2/blob/cc56ad0f3439c502c246fc5cfcc3db92bb8b7219/test/AllowanceTransferTest.t.sol#L58-L85\n\n```\nfunction setUp() public {\n        permit2 = new Permit2();\n```\n\n### permit2@latest::AllowanceTransferTest::__contract__~6\n`permit2@latest` · repo:cc56ad0f3439c502c246fc5cfcc3db92bb8b7219 · as_of 2023-09-29T15:36:13Z\nhttps://github.com/Uniswap/permit2/blob/cc56ad0f3439c502c246fc5cfcc3db92bb8b7219/test/AllowanceTransferTest.t.sol#L636-L665\n\n```\nassertEq(expiration, defaultExpiration);\n```\n\n### permit2@latest::DeployPermit2Test::permit2\n`permit2@latest` · repo:cc56ad0f3439c502c246fc5cfcc3db92bb8b7219 · as_of 2023-09-29T15:36:13Z\nhttps://github.com/Uniswap/permit2/blob/cc56ad0f3439c502c246fc5cfcc3db92bb8b7219/test/utils/DeployPermit2.t.sol#L13-L43\n\n```\nPermit2 permit2;\naddress from;\nuint256 fromPrivateKey;\naddress address0 = address(0);\naddress address1 = address(2);\nuint160 defaultAmount = 10 ** 18;\nuint48 defaultNonce = 0;\nuint32 dirtyNonce = 1;\nuint48 defaultExpiration = uint48(block.timestamp + 5);\n+3 more units in this chunk\n```\n\n### permit2@latest::MockPermit2::__contract__\n`permit2@latest` · repo:cc56ad0f3439c502c246fc5cfcc3db92bb8b7219 · as_of 2023-09-29T15:36:13Z\nhttps://github.com/Uniswap/permit2/blob/cc56ad0f3439c502c246fc5cfcc3db92bb8b7219/test/mocks/MockPermit2.sol#L8-L49\n\n```\ncontract MockPermit2 is Permit2 {\n    function doStore(address from, address token, address spender, uint256 word) public {\n```\n\n### permit2@latest::SignatureTransferTest::FULL_EXAMPLE_WITNESS_BATCH_TYPEHASH\n`permit2@latest` · repo:cc56ad0f3439c502c246fc5cfcc3db92bb8b7219 · as_of 2023-09-29T15:36:13Z\nhttps://github.com/Uniswap/permit2/blob/cc56ad0f3439c502c246fc5cfcc3db92bb8b7219/test/SignatureTransfer.t.sol#L49-L94\n\n```\nbytes32 constant FULL_EXAMPLE_WITNESS_BATCH_TYPEHASH = keccak256(\nPermit2 permit2;\naddress from;\nuint256 fromPrivateKey;\nuint256 defaultAmount = 1 ** 18;\naddress address0 = address(0x0);\naddress address2 = address(0x2);\nbytes32 DOMAIN_SEPARATOR;\nfunction setUp() public\n+2 more units in this chunk\n```\n\n### permit2@latest::AllowanceUnitTest::testUpdateAllRandomly\n`permit2@latest` · repo:cc56ad0f3439c502c246fc5cfcc3db92bb8b7219 · as_of 2023-09-29T15:36:13Z\nhttps://github.com/Uniswap/permit2/blob/cc56ad0f3439c502c246fc5cfcc3db92bb8b7219/test/AllowanceUnitTest.sol#L36-L71\n\n```\nfunction testUpdateAllRandomly(uint160 amount, uint48 expiration, uint48 nonce) public\nfunction testPackAndUnpack(uint160 amount, uint48 expiration, uint48 nonce) public\n(2 units in this chunk)\n```\n\n### permit2@latest::Spender::__contract__\n`permit2@latest` · repo:cc56ad0f3439c502c246fc5cfcc3db92bb8b7219 · as_of 2023-09-29T15:36:13Z\nhttps://github.com/Uniswap/permit2/blob/cc56ad0f3439c502c246fc5cfcc3db92bb8b7219/test/actors/Spender.sol#L7-L22\n\n```\ncontract Spender is Test {\n    Permit2 private immutable permit2;\n```\n\n### permit2@latest::NonceBitmapTest::permit2\n`permit2@latest` · repo:cc56ad0f3439c502c246fc5cfcc3db92bb8b7219 · as_of 2023-09-29T15:36:13Z\nhttps://github.com/Uniswap/permit2/blob/cc56ad0f3439c502c246fc5cfcc3db92bb8b7219/test/NonceBitmap.t.sol#L10-L48\n\n```\nMockPermit2 permit2;\nfunction setUp() public\nfunction testLowNonces() public\nfunction testNonceWordBoundary() public\nfunction testHighNonces() public\n(5 units in this chunk)\n```\n\n### permit2@latest::Permit2LibTest::testSimplePermit2PlusTransferFrom2WithNonPermit\n`permit2@latest` · repo:cc56ad0f3439c502c246fc5cfcc3db92bb8b7219 · as_of 2023-09-29T15:36:13Z\nhttps://github.com/Uniswap/permit2/blob/cc56ad0f3439c502c246fc5cfcc3db92bb8b7219/test/Permit2Lib.t.sol#L576-L616\n\n```\nfunction testSimplePermit2PlusTransferFrom2WithNonPermit() public\nfunction testPermit2DSLessToken() public\nfunction testPermit2DSMoreToken() public\nfunction testPermit2DSMore32Token() public\n(4 units in this chunk)\n```"}],"structuredContent":{"intent":"lookup","recipe":null,"hits":[{"selector":"permit2@latest::AllowanceTransferTest::__contract__~7","source_url":"https://github.com/Uniswap/permit2/blob/cc56ad0f3439c502c246fc5cfcc3db92bb8b7219/test/AllowanceTransferTest.t.sol#L666-L694","snippet":"bytes memory sig = getPermitBatchSignature(permit, fromPrivateKey, DOMAIN_SEPARATOR);","project":"permit2","version":"latest","version_defaulted":false,"last_validated":"2026-08-13T03:54:35Z","as_of":"2023-09-29T15:36:13Z","provenance_kind":"repo","pin_ref":"cc56ad0f3439c502c246fc5cfcc3db92bb8b7219"},{"selector":"permit2@latest::AllowanceTransferTest::setUp","source_url":"https://github.com/Uniswap/permit2/blob/cc56ad0f3439c502c246fc5cfcc3db92bb8b7219/test/AllowanceTransferTest.t.sol#L58-L85","snippet":"function setUp() public {\n        permit2 = new Permit2();","project":"permit2","version":"latest","version_defaulted":false,"last_validated":"2026-08-13T03:54:35Z","as_of":"2023-09-29T15:36:13Z","provenance_kind":"repo","pin_ref":"cc56ad0f3439c502c246fc5cfcc3db92bb8b7219"},{"selector":"permit2@latest::AllowanceTransferTest::__contract__~6","source_url":"https://github.com/Uniswap/permit2/blob/cc56ad0f3439c502c246fc5cfcc3db92bb8b7219/test/AllowanceTransferTest.t.sol#L636-L665","snippet":"assertEq(expiration, defaultExpiration);","project":"permit2","version":"latest","version_defaulted":false,"last_validated":"2026-08-13T03:54:35Z","as_of":"2023-09-29T15:36:13Z","provenance_kind":"repo","pin_ref":"cc56ad0f3439c502